encoding  utf-8
survey ToplessClimb

input ToplessClimb.th2
input ToplessClimbEe.th2
input ToplessClimbE90.th2

map ToplessClimbM
  ToplessClimbSP1
 break
  ToplessClimbSP2
endmap

map ToplessClimbME
  ToplessClimbSE1
  ToplessClimbSE2
endmap

map ToplessClimbME90 -proj [elevation 90]
  ToplessClimbSE90_1
endmap
centreline

